      "text": "/swarm spawns background subagents as separate zot subprocesses sharing the host's working directory, with a dashboard, per-agent session files and unix-socket inboxes under $ZOT_HOME/swarm/agents/<id>/, and persistence across restarts as detached agents."
    },
